# Fade
# Level 1 - Basics
#
# An LED slowly brightens and dims, like breathing.
# You learn: 'as pwm' (levels between off and on), percentages and fade().
# You need: an LED and a 220 ohm resistor: pin 9 -> resistor -> LED long leg, LED short leg -> GND.
# Only pins marked ~ on the board can fade (on an Uno: 3, 5, 6, 9, 10, 11).

board uno

led = pin 9 as pwm

task breathe:
    while true:
        led.fade(to: 100 %, over: 1 s)   # fade() works in the background and returns at once...
        wait 1 s                         # ...so wait while it happens
        led.fade(to: 0 %, over: 1 s)
        wait 1 s
